{"verse_key": "10:42", "surah": 10, "verse": 42, "text_uthmani": "وَمِنْهُم مَّن يَسْتَمِعُونَ إِلَيْكَ ۚ أَفَأَنتَ تُسْمِعُ ٱلصُّمَّ وَلَوْ كَانُوا۟ لَا يَعْقِلُونَ", "translation": "And among them are those who listen to you. But can you cause the deaf to hear [i.e., benefit from this hearing], although they will not use reason?", "verse_from_ms": 1036780, "verse_to_ms": 1052530, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَمِنْهُم", "start_ms": 1036780, "end_ms": 1038000}, {"i": 1, "text": "مَّن", "start_ms": 1038000, "end_ms": 1038810}, {"i": 2, "text": "يَسْتَمِعُونَ", "start_ms": 1038810, "end_ms": 1040740}, {"i": 3, "text": "إِلَيْكَ", "start_ms": 1040740, "end_ms": 1043750}, {"i": 4, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 1043750, "end_ms": 1045350}, {"i": 5, "text": "أَفَأَنتَ", "start_ms": 1045350, "end_ms": 1046100}, {"i": 6, "text": "تُسْمِعُ", "start_ms": 1046100, "end_ms": 1047300}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱلصُّمَّ", "start_ms": 1047300, "end_ms": 1047810}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَلَوْ", "start_ms": 1047810, "end_ms": 1048760}, {"i": 9, "text": "كَانُوا۟", "start_ms": 1048760, "end_ms": 1049190}, {"i": 10, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 1049190, "end_ms": 1052065}, {"i": 11, "text": "يَعْقِلُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}